1
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:06,000
The Hideout is a horror, mystery, thriller film directed by Pupi Avati.

2
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:06,000
A mystery-thriller about an Italian woman who moves
to Davenport to open a restaurant.

3
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:06,000
After her husband commits suicide, she spends fifteen years
recovering at a Minnesota mental hospital.

4
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:06,000
When she builds herself up enough to begin another restaurant, she
discovers that a murder took place there fifty years earlier.

5
00:25:00,000 --> 00:25:06,000
She decides to investigate and finds a secret plot.

6
00:30:00,000 --> 00:30:06,000
Lei, played by Laura Morante.

7
00:35:00,000 --> 00:35:06,000
Paula Hardyn, played by Rita Tushingham.

8
00:40:00,000 --> 00:40:06,000
Mueller, played by Burt Young.

9
00:45:00,000 --> 00:45:06,000
Padre Amy, played by Treat Williams.

10
00:50:00,000 --> 00:50:06,000
Ella Murray, played by Yvonne Sciò.

11
00:55:00,000 --> 00:55:06,000
Vincent, played by Giovanni Lombardo Radice.

12
01:00:00,000 --> 01:00:06,000
The Hideout (Italian: Il nascondiglio) is a 2007 Italian-American
mystery film written and directed by Pupi Avati.

13
01:05:00,000 --> 01:05:06,000
It marked the comeback of Avati to the thriller genre (a genre he had successfully explored decades before in films such
as The House with Laughing Windows and Zeder) after a series of intimate dramas and nostalgic comedies.

14
01:10:00,000 --> 01:10:06,000
A more silent but very well made film from the Giallo Genre by Pupi Avati, that plays perfectly
with the dark, gloomy atmosphere of an old, spooky house and its deadly secrets.

15
01:15:00,000 --> 01:15:06,000
The protagonist of the film spent 15 years of her life in a mental asylum,
recovering from a nervous breakdown, after her husband committed suicide.

16
01:20:00,000 --> 01:20:06,000
With the intention to start a new life and to open a
restaurant, she moves into an old, historical mansion.

17
01:25:00,000 --> 01:25:06,000
But she starts to feel she is not alone in this big, dark, building..

18
01:30:00,000 --> 01:30:06,000
hearing frightening voices in the darkness and seeing things in the house, she starts to doubt her own mental
sanity again, until she discovers a gruesome crime that happened 50 years back and its horrible secret.

19
01:35:00,000 --> 01:35:06,000
The tone is intense and dark and mind_bending.
